WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:05.130 --> 00:00:07.340
 Welcome. I'm Andrew Fuller,

00:00:07.340 --> 00:00:10.427
season one winner of Netflix's Is It Cake

00:00:10.427 --> 00:00:12.429
and to celebrate the
premiere of Wednesday,

00:00:12.429 --> 00:00:14.347
I made a Thing cake.

00:00:14.347 --> 00:00:15.473
Which one is it?

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:20.270
Is it Thing one or Thing two?

00:00:20.270 --> 00:00:24.024
Let's see if the stars of
Wednesday can figure it out.

00:00:24.024 --> 00:00:26.693
Welcome to my cake room.

00:00:26.693 --> 00:00:27.986
 Thank you!

00:00:27.986 --> 00:00:30.530
 I have made a cake of Thing

00:00:30.530 --> 00:00:34.200
and it's your job to
figure out which one it is.

00:00:34.200 --> 00:00:38.413
Is it Thing one or is it Thing two?

00:00:38.413 --> 00:00:40.415
 Wow, how long did it
take you to make it?

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:41.875
 Far, far too long.

00:00:41.875 --> 00:00:42.876
I'll never do it again.

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:45.545
 Okay first of all, my
eyesight is really bad, so.

00:00:45.545 --> 00:00:46.379
 Perfect.

00:00:46.379 --> 00:00:47.839
 I mean, if I were to say,

00:00:48.757 --> 00:00:51.217
I wouldn't know.

00:00:51.217 --> 00:00:53.970
- It looks delicious.
- I was about to say.

00:00:53.970 --> 00:00:55.096
 Yeah, I just wanna eat it.

00:00:55.096 --> 00:00:56.473
Tell me why you think it's one?

00:00:56.473 --> 00:00:58.975
 It’s bigger.

00:00:58.975 --> 00:00:59.809
 It’s bigger.

00:00:59.809 --> 00:01:01.519
 And, you know, and like it, you know,

00:01:01.519 --> 00:01:04.105
cake expands, you know
when you're making it.

00:01:04.189 --> 00:01:07.233
 Number two does not look too expanding.

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:09.235
 The texture. You can see the texture.

00:01:09.235 --> 00:01:10.278
Looks like cake.

00:01:10.278 --> 00:01:11.321
 I'm gonna go two.

00:01:11.321 --> 00:01:12.530
Okay. Two.

00:01:12.530 --> 00:01:13.782
 Noooo!

00:01:13.782 --> 00:01:15.116
 Now you're making me second guess it.

00:01:15.116 --> 00:01:17.202
That's what they do on 
Who Wants to be a Millionaire.

00:01:17.202 --> 00:01:18.078
They make you second guess yourself.

00:01:18.078 --> 00:01:19.579
I have to stay with my answer.

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.831
Alright. Time for the big reveal.

00:01:30.548 --> 00:01:32.675
Yeah, it's cake!

00:01:32.675 --> 00:01:34.219
It's number one!

00:01:35.929 --> 00:01:37.388
The show will go on.

00:01:37.388 --> 00:01:40.475
Congratulations. You win $100,000.

00:01:40.475 --> 00:01:42.185
- For real?
- No.

00:01:42.185 --> 00:01:43.436
- Fantastic.
- Thank you so much.

00:01:43.436 --> 00:01:44.979
 Beautiful. Tasted great.

00:01:45.647 --> 00:01:47.148
Bye. I love you. Thank you so much.

00:01:47.148 --> 00:01:49.567
I'm dead now. I'm dead. I'm dead.

00:01:49.567 --> 00:01:51.569
And no matter what, don't stop baking.

00:01:51.569 --> 00:01:53.905
Never. Thank you. Nice to meet you.

00:01:53.905 --> 00:01:54.823
Thank you guys.

00:01:54.948 --> 00:01:59.202
Thank you Netflix for having
me at the Wednesday premiere.

00:01:59.202 --> 00:02:04.958
Truly, this experience for
me, has been unbelievable.

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:08.711
I can't believe I just
cut Thing with Tim Burton.

00:02:09.671 --> 00:02:11.422
Ahhh!

00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:14.217
My life is over. Cut. It's a wrap.

00:02:14.217 --> 00:02:15.093
Thanks for watching. 

00:02:15.093 --> 00:02:17.345
Check out Wednesday only on Netflix.

